onomous coding features achieving 80.8% on SWE-bench.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type release\">Release</span>\n                        2026-04-11\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/2026-04-16-claude-opus-4-7-is-generally-available/\" target=\"_blank\">Claude Opus 4.7 on Copilot</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Anthropic's latest Opus model now rolling out on GitHub Copilot with stronger multi-step task performance and more reliable agentic execution.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                        2026-04-16\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/2026-04-16-manage-agent-skills-with-github-cli/\" target=\"_blank\">Manage Agent Skills with GitHub CLI</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        New 'gh skill' command for discovering, installing, and managing agent skills, reshaping how developers work with AI coding agents.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                        2026-04-16\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/2026-04-15-enable-copilot-cloud-agent-via-custom-properties/\" target=\"_blank\">Copilot Cloud Agent Policy</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Organizations can now selectively enable GitHub Copilot cloud agent access on a per-organization basis using custom properties.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                        2026-04-15\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/2026-04-14-model-selection-for-claude-and-codex-agents-on-github-com/\" target=\"_blank\">Model Selection for Agents</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Model selection now available for Claude and Codex third-party coding agents on github.com, similar to Copilot cloud agent.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                        2026-04-14\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/2026-04-13-fix-merge-conflicts-in-three-clicks-with-copilot-cloud-agent/\" target=\"_blank\">Fix Merge Conflicts with Copilot</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        New 'Fix with Copilot' button on github.com allows fixing merge conflicts in three clicks powered by Copilot cloud agent.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                        2026-04-13\n                    </div>\n             