Fang et al. • 2026-04-17\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"insight-title\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type news\">News</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/04/17/factory-1-5b-valuation-ai-coding/\" target=\"_blank\">Factory $1.5B Valuation</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-description\">\n                        AI coding startup reaches $1.5B valuation for enterprise solutions.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-meta\">\n                        Marina Temkin • 2026-04-17\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"insight-title\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Tech</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\" target=\"_blank\">llm-anthropic 0.25</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-description\">\n                        Claude Opus 4.7 support with thinking_effort: xhigh and enhanced options.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-meta\">\n                        Simon Willison • 2026-04-16\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"insight-title\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type opinion\">Opinion</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Qwen vs Claude: Pelican Benchmark</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-description\">\n                        Comparison of Qwen3.6-35B-A3B and Claude Opus 4.7 on pelican riding bicycle.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-meta\">\n                        Simon Willison • 2026-04-16\n    